  "meaning": "A token-and-theme register on a low machined mounting plate with rounded plan corners and flush fasteners carries repeated engraved token groups through a large transverse registration tool with a thick slotted roof and broad end pedestals. The broad output groups use oxide-brown, sage-green, and blue enamel inlays beneath a massive registration head. A keyed theme cassette, knurled adjustment wheel, guide rods, comb teeth, engraved calibration marks, and retained feed spool form one detailed mechanical assembly. Detailed machined construction, actual recessed marks, separate fasteners, brushed polished steel, dark red-brown granular corrosion islands with broken oxide rims, pitted normal relief and dull oxidized metal between crusts, graphite interiors, directional softbox reflections, and genuine transparent negative space.",
